===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Meltan|177}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Amass''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Drampa|97}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
